{{about|the type of downloadable content|other uses|Texture pack (disambiguation)}}
{{exclusive|bedrock|console|New3DS}}
[[File:PEAlpha0158.png|thumb|300px|A scene in ''Minecraft'' with the Fantasy Texture Pack applied.]]
{{IN|be|lce|3ds}}, a '''texture pack''' is a type of [[DLC|downloadable content]] that can be bought from the [[Marketplace]] (or the platform's storefront {{in|LCE}}) which customizes the appearance of the game by replacing the default [[textures]]. They consist of [[resource packs]] which can be applied locally for the player only in "[[Settings#Global Resources|Global Resources]]", or for all players in a [[world]] or [[server]].

In addition to separately available texture packs, [[mash-up packs]] come bundled with texture packs as well.

